	(text "conversion here is non-linear,\nand will need to be accounted for.\ncommon values: 20M (dark) .. 20K (bright)\n---\nV_measured/3.3 = Rp/(Rp+Rref)\nRp = -Rref*v/(v-1)\n   = 1,000,000*(A0/4096)/(1 - (A0/4096))"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 67.31 64.77 0)
